      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "something i just thought about that might help. I've not been able to test the VRC_VoiceOverrideRegion so im not sure how much of a issue there is with this. for overlapping zones which override will be used, with global settings the same issue might occur. so having a priority option for which override will be chosen could be helpful. i can put this in a separate canny if needed.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
