      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{59b05781f76da93741a4617e|full_name}: Correct! Overlapping zones won't work as expected until the priority param on https://docs.vrchat.com/v2019.2.5/docs/vrc_voiceoverrideregion is implemented. We will get this working soon.",
