  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "previously we had the custom falloff range in the scene descriptor to set how voice falloff should work in worlds. in this new system while adding in custom zones you've taken away global settings. while people can just make a huge box for the world it would be cleaner to have a global check box. im taking this off of how postprocessing v2 lets you choose between global or volume.",
